        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Gulping Charge"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The gluttonworm Strides up to double its Speed and can move through the spaces of Large or smaller creatures, gulping each creature whose space the worm enters and attempting a body Strike against each of them. The gluttonworm can use this Strike on each creature only once in a single use of Gulping Charge. Creatures can attempt a 41 basic Reflex save against this damage."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "three_actions"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
            "action_damage_variants": {
              "value": []
            },
            "id": "33460a37-3698-4405-a6f8-73ae4ce99bdc",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:59:14.471514"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Spew Sandstorm"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(air, earth, evocation, primal)\n\nThe gluttonworm exhales swirling sand in a 60-foot cone. Creatures in the area must attempt a 41 Reflex save. It can't Spew Sandstorm again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes 4d6 slashing damage and 4d6 bludgeoning damage from the scouring sand.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes 8d6 slashing damage and 8d6 bludgeoning damage from the sand, and is dazzled until the end of its next turn.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature takes 12d6 slashing damage and 12d6 bludgeoning damage and is blinded for 1 hour."
            },
